pyJVM linking exception
=======================

SPDX identifier: AdditionRef-pyJVM-Linking-Exception

Applies to:
  * every file under runtime/ (the pyJVM runtime and parser: Java packages
    pyjvm315.runtime and pyjvm315.parser);
  * the in-process compiler that `exec`, `eval` and `compile` load from the
    classpath, i.e. the Python modules listed in `CORE` in
    pyjvm315/selfhost.py (compiler, classfile, stackmap, patma, annot,
    astutil, versions) and the class files built from them;
  * the runtime, compiler and stdlib jars built from the above.

